<title>USA: Alternative Technology names Keen CEO.</title>
<headline>Alternative Technology names Keen CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alternative Technology Resources Inc Monday named W. Robert Keen as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said George Van Derven will continue as the company's president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Keen, who joined the company as a director in November, is the owner of Jonathan Companies, a management consulting company.</p>
